<title>USA: Cafe La France begins stock offering.</title>
<headline>Cafe La France begins stock offering.</headline>
<dateline>PROVIDENCE, R.I. 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cafe La France, a gourmet cafe chain, said Saturday it has received approval from the Securities and Exchange Commission to begin its initial public offering of up to 1.125 million common shares.</p>
<p>The shares are being sold at $4 each through Earnhardt &amp; Co, the lead underwriter, it said.</p>
<p>The offering is scheduled to end on June 30, but may be extended for an additional 120 days, it said.</p>
</text>
